{"id":"pre_ce_dent","lemma":"précédent","pos":"adj","rank":3549,"glosses":["previous; preceding; earlier"],"ipa":"/pʁe.se.dɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/58/Fr-pr%C3%A9c%C3%A9dent.ogg/Fr-pr%C3%A9c%C3%A9dent.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"précédente","masculinePlural":"précédents","femininePlural":"précédentes"},"formAudio":{"précédente":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-pr%C3%A9c%C3%A9dente.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je l'ai rencontré le jour précédent.","en":"I met him the day before.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to meet","l":"rencontrer"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"day"},null]},{"text":"Je l'avais acheté la semaine précédente.","en":"I'd bought it the week before.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to purchase","l":"acheter"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"week"},null]},{"text":"C'est sans précédent.","en":"This is unprecedented.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Je voudrais revenir sur ma déclaration précédente.","en":"I would like to retract my previous statement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to come back"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"declaration"},null]},{"text":"Cet article est plus intéressant que le précédent.","en":"This article is more interesting than the previous one.","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"article"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"more / no longer"},{"g":"interesting"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}